# second's, then the high lanes); Abs returns the unsigned element type as .NET declares it;
# PMULDQ / PMULUDQ multiply the even 32-bit lanes into 64-bit products; PSIGN passes, negates
# or zeroes each lane by the sign of the second operand's lane.
target = avx2
